WEBVTT

00:00:00.000 --> 00:00:02.000
Reading the Demand Score

00:00:02.000 --> 00:00:03.900
Every listing gets a Demand Score from 0 to 100.

00:00:03.900 --> 00:00:06.833
Hover the score for the breakdown.

00:00:06.833 --> 00:00:10.433
Saves and views, scaled 0–100. Days on market falls from 100 to 0 over 90 days.

00:00:10.433 --> 00:00:13.233
Pace bonus: saves and views per day add up to ±10.

00:00:13.233 --> 00:00:15.833
It describes buyer activity on Zillow, not the home’s price.

00:00:15.833 --> 00:00:18.033
On a search page, every card gets a badge.

00:00:18.033 --> 00:00:23.567
Sort Listings → Demand Score.

00:00:23.567 --> 00:00:30.500
Hottest listings first, with the badge on every card.

00:00:30.500 --> 00:00:34.500
Free right now on the Chrome Web Store · usecaza.com

